2243 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am a full\055stack developer with over 10 years experience in the industry\054 working extensively with various tech stacks\056 At the beginning of my career\054 I undertook several web internships at agencies throughout Brisbane and\054 after graduating\054 I began working as a full time web developer\056 With knowledgeable mentorship\054 I gained valuable skills and my interest in the web industry increased\056\nWorking locally and overseas has provided a diverse range of experience in unique work and life cultures\056 Full time educational work\054 with freelance development jobs on the side\054 allowed me to explore an interest in teaching\054 which would later lead to a web design tutoring role at the University of Queensland when back in Australia\056 I later took on a senior front\055end developer job then progressed to senior full\055stack and developer positions\054 undertaking increasingly challenging roles\056 Within a senior capacity\054 I have been involved in strategic discussions regarding product offerings\054 provided key technical advice to steer the direction of business decisions and managed staff while collaborating with multiple teams\056)
